(text "CONNECTORS rev 0.7. NOT FOR FABRICATION.\\nSix housings. Pins inside one housing are not joined. UP_RET is not DN_RET. REED_RET is not GND. GND_CAN is not GND.\\nJ_PWR, J_CONTACT and J_PERM are 3.5 mm screw terminals. J_REED, J_SENSE and J_NMEA are latched JST XH, 3 A, not a sealed marine plug.\\nJ_REED pin 2 and pin 4 are both REED_RET, so each cable has its own return wire. That is one net, not a second ground.\\nJ_SENSE is a 5-pin XH. Pin 3 is unused so UP_RET and DN_FIELD are not adjacent. UP_RET is not DN_RET.\\nNET-S is pin 5 of J_NMEA and is a no-connect. Shield is not MCU ground." (at 20 260 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))) (uuid "b5a6f317-be93-4c72-86b1-6b452c78e434"))
