(text "J_NMEA pin order is the PCB header, not a Micro-C. Pigtail to a drop plug:\\n1 GND_CAN -> NET-C (black). 2 CAN_L -> NET-L (blue). 3 SHIELD -> shield, capacitor to GND_CAN only.\\n4 CAN_H -> NET-H (white). 5 NET-S is open on this PCB. Do not land the red wire. This board does not draw backbone power." (at 200 145 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))) (uuid "6034d84e-df68-41d6-8005-01271c12eed4"))
